uery=Online+Threats+See+the+World+Anew", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Online+Threats+See+the+World+Anew", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Online+Threats+See+the+World+Anew", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=Online+Threats+See+the+World+Anew", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Online+Threats+See+the+World+Anew", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Online+Threats+See+the+World+Anew&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["“a couple of older ones from last year as well, Online Threats with See the World Anew”", "mentioned by the presenter but we couldn't work out when it played"]}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 5, "low": 7}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:36:58", "end": "00:37:14", "text": "We're listening to Deep Web, me, Heidi, covering for Krishtie and Chuyi tonight. Shout out, Carlin, holding down. The past hour on the bridge before nine."}, {"start": "00:38:39", "end": "00:39:02", "text": "The producer Evian Christ, an old re-heat from the Reverend Christ album that came out nearly a decade ago now, and a couple of older ones from last year as well, Online Threats with See the World Anew, Genome 6.66, and..."}, {"start": "00:40:38", "end": "00:40:59", "text": "I guess the kind of fake euphoria or ecstasy kind of elicits in you the kind of cringe and corniness I guess that some people kind of like dismiss it as I've been really loving recently."}, {"start": "00:41:13", "end": "00:41:31", "text": "A lot of edits on SoundCloud in that kind of similar vein of mashing up existing music, familiar music and kind of placing it in a new context, a new reinterpretation."}, {"start": "00:42:08", "end": "00:42:27", "text": "I feel like it's quite fitting. Like this show tonight is my unofficial soundtrack for GTA 6 release. Sense of, I guess, driving through Miami, Florida."}, {"start": "00:42:32", "end": "00:42:59", "text": "Yeah, we'll see where tonight goes. I've got a couple tracks loaded that I really want to get into. I've got some great artists out of Helsinki. Some incredible producers in the realm of Bladen and Quit Life that I want to get into tonight. And I want to get more into the Colombian, Chile, Latin American."}, {"start": "01:08:04", "end": "01:09:20", "text": ""}, {"start": "01:24:47", "end": "01:25:56", "text": "What the fuck?"}, {"start": "01:26:38", "end": "01:27:17", "text": "We'll be right back."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:00"}, "track": {"title": "Kiss Me Slowly", "artists": [{"name": "Orian"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:05:00"}, "track": {"title": "Kvlt.xx (Vol. 1)", "artists": [{"name": "edel's files"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:22:53"}, "track": {"title": "Night Shift (feat. Pz' & cfye)", "artists": [{"name": "Slump Audios & DJ BANNED"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:32:21"}, "track": {"title": "Cold Beer Calling My Name", "artists": [{"name": "Jameson Rodgers & Luke Combs"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:37:00"}, "track": {"title": "Find (FSOE881)", "artists": [{"name": "Ridgewalkers & E.L."}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:42:00"}, "track": {"title": "Gelatin Nature", "artists": [{"name": "Ooyy"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:48:00"}, "track": {"title": "Money Spree", "artists": [{"name": "67"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:51:00"}, "track": {"title": "U Write The Rules (Original Mix;As